"Self Mastery is a hard wordchain; its Artonan title means roughly 'My Body Becomes my Assistant'."
"It has no official English translation and a full gesture set from fingers to shoulders."
"It heightens bodily awareness, control and spatial sense; best-day skill becomes natural."
"Its side effects include hyperawareness of friction, noise and stomach, terrible when bored."
"Its fallout is triple klutziness, poor bodily awareness and falling asleep easily."
"Its official Palace name is My Body Becomes My Assistant; some call it Gracefulness."
"Teaching it needs Palace permission, with the teacher vouching for the student."
